{"title":"Lizper Spitter","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Lizper that attacks with stab (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (2.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=42\">Lv 42</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>38</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>66</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>18</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td>